@url = http://localhost:3001

### Registar uma conta de teste
# @name registar
POST {{url}}/autenticacao/registar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Conta Teste",
  "email": "teste@example.com",
  "password": "passwordInicial1"
}

###
@token = {{registar.response.body.token}}

### Ver o perfil
GET {{url}}/autenticacao/eu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alterar só o nome (não pede password)
PATCH {{url}}/autenticacao/eu
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Conta Teste Alterada"
}

### Alterar o email SEM password (deve dar 400)
PATCH {{url}}/autenticacao/eu
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "novo@example.com"
}

### Alterar o email com a password
PATCH {{url}}/autenticacao/eu
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "novo@example.com",
  "passwordAtual": "passwordInicial1"
}

### Alterar a password
POST {{url}}/autenticacao/alterar-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "passwordAtual": "passwordInicial1",
  "novaPassword": "passwordNova123"
}

### Entrar com o email e a password novos
POST {{url}}/autenticacao/entrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@example.com",
  "password": "passwordNova123"
}

### Apagar a conta com a password errada (deve dar 400)
POST {{url}}/autenticacao/apagar-conta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "password": "errada"
}

### Apagar a conta
POST {{url}}/autenticacao/apagar-conta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "password": "passwordNova123"
}